OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe chance
OL,6,Fof a few showers in the west in the
OL,7,Fevening, otherwise it will stay dry
OL,8,Fwith clear spells at times through the
OL,9,Fevening and overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FThe day will continue dry with
OL,12,Fbright or sunny spells increasing into
OL,13,Fthe afternoon. Cloud will spread east
OL,14,Fin the evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,17,Fdry with sunny spells then patchy rain
OL,18,Fspreading south Saturday afternoon.
OL,19,FSunday and Monday will continue mostly
OL,20,Fdry with bright or sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
